## Content Repurposing System

Turn one substantial piece of content into multiple platform-specific assets.

### Blog Post to Social Content

| Platform | Format |
|----------|--------|
| LinkedIn | Key insight with a relevant link or discussion prompt |
| LinkedIn | Carousel summarizing the main points |
| Twitter/X | Thread of key takeaways |
| Instagram | Educational carousel |
| Instagram | Reel summarizing the post |
| TikTok | Short-form video explaining one key insight |
| Facebook | Discussion post or adapted summary |

### Repurposing Workflow

1. **Create pillar content:** Start with a blog post, video, podcast, research report, interview, or another substantial source.
2. **Extract key insights:** Identify 3–5 useful ideas, lessons, data points, or questions.
3. **Adapt to each platform:** Change the hook, structure, length, format, tone, and CTA to match platform behavior.
4. **Schedule distribution:** Spread related content across an appropriate period rather than publishing every version simultaneously.
5. **Update and reshare:** Revisit evergreen content when it remains accurate and relevant.
6. **Track performance:** Compare how different adaptations perform and use the findings to improve future repurposing.

Do not simply copy and paste identical content across every platform. Preserve the core idea while adapting its presentation.

