## Content Ideas by Situation

### When You're Starting Out

- Document the learning or building process when appropriate.
- Share useful lessons and discoveries.
- Curate and comment on relevant industry content.
- Answer common audience questions.
- Engage with established accounts and communities.
- Test different content pillars and formats.

### When You're Stuck

- Repurpose previously successful content.
- Ask the audience what they want to learn.
- Review customer questions and feedback.
- Comment on relevant industry news.
- Share a genuine lesson learned.
- Revisit content pillars and identify missing topics.

Do not invent personal stories or claim direct experience that the brand or author does not have.

