## Scheduling Best Practices

### When to Schedule vs. Post Live

**Schedule:**
- Core content posts.
- Planned threads and carousels.
- Evergreen educational content.
- Campaign content with approved publishing dates.

**Post live:**
- Real-time commentary.
- Responses to current news or trends.
- Conversations and replies.
- Community engagement.
- Time-sensitive updates.

### Queue Management

- Maintain an appropriate buffer of scheduled content.
- Review the queue regularly for relevance and accuracy.
- Leave space for spontaneous and timely posts.
- Adjust publishing times based on account performance.
- Remove or revise scheduled posts when circumstances make them inappropriate.

Never publish content automatically when human approval is required.

